WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.403
- Why am I nervous?

00:00:02.621 --> 00:00:05.640
(gentle piano music)

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:06.740
- It feels weird calling right now,

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.853
I'm a little nervous.

00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:10.410
(laughs)

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.202
- He's probably going to be very confused.

00:00:12.202 --> 00:00:13.035
(phone ringing)

00:00:13.035 --> 00:00:15.010
I just wanted to call
and tell you something.

00:00:15.611 --> 00:00:17.390
- [Woman's father] What
were you gonna tell me?

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:18.223
You're married?

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:20.711
- No! (laughs)

00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:23.011
I just wanted to call
and tell you I love you.

00:00:23.692 --> 00:00:26.362
- [Woman's father] That's very
nice of you, I appreciate it.

00:00:26.362 --> 00:00:28.981
I'm glad you love me 'cause
that's very important to me.

00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:29.814
- Aw.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.870
- Hi, dad!
- Hey, Liz!

00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:34.097
- How are you?
- I'm good. How are you?

00:00:34.097 --> 00:00:35.750
- I'm good, I just wanted to call

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.743
and say that I love you and I miss you.

00:00:38.074 --> 00:00:39.424
- (laughs) I love you, too.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.640
- I just wanted to call and
tell you that I love you.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.723
- [Woman's father] Oh,
that's nice! (woman laughs)

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:48.773
I'll take that.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.160
- I'll take that?! (laughs)

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.697
Why do you think dads have a
hard time saying I love you?

00:00:56.895 --> 00:00:59.360
- [Woman's father] Oh, I, it's just...

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.460
I don't understand, you guys make it...

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.470
You guys have it so easy and
you can say that so easily.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:06.483
I don't know.

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.433
It's 'cause it's some kind
of defect in our jaws.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.123
- In the jaw?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.700
- [Woman's father] Yeah, it's in our jaws.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.960
- Oh my god, that's
bullshit. (woman laughs)

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:18.980
- [Woman's Father] Well, I,
okay. Well, I love you too.

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.620
And--
- I'll take that.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:26.183
- [Woman's Father] And that's
really sweet of you to call.

00:01:26.392 --> 00:01:28.233
It's an unexpected delight.

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:31.020
- Hi!
- I just wanted to call you

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.210
and tell you that I love you.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.223
- That's great!

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.723
Couple days early for
that, but that's fine.

00:01:37.880 --> 00:01:40.040
- Do you love me, too?
- Love it.

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:40.873
I love you too!

00:01:42.087 --> 00:01:45.103
- [Alec] I just wanted to
let you know that I love you.

00:01:47.033 --> 00:01:47.866
- Aww!

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.680
And I love you too, Thank you Alec.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:54.423
- I just wanted to call
and say that I love you.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.003
- [Woman's Father] Aw, I love you too.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.773
- How's your day going?
- [Woman's father] Very much.

00:01:58.773 --> 00:01:59.606
- Aww!

00:01:59.843 --> 00:02:03.053
- I just wanted to call
and say that I love you.

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:05.200
- Well, I love you too.

00:02:05.352 --> 00:02:07.602
(laughing)

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.624
- Um, that's awesome. (laughing)

00:02:11.624 --> 00:02:12.707
- Well, good.

00:02:12.773 --> 00:02:13.913
- What do you want, now? (laughs)

00:02:13.913 --> 00:02:16.413
- [Woman] But I'm just
calling to say, I love you!

00:02:16.984 --> 00:02:17.923
- I love you too!

00:02:17.923 --> 00:02:20.127
- [Woman] Bye!
- Bye have a great night!

00:02:20.127 --> 00:02:22.790
- Because I don't have too
long, I just wanted to call

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:24.577
and tell you that I love you.

00:02:25.529 --> 00:02:26.849
- Well, I love you too, man.

00:02:26.849 --> 00:02:28.260
- Thanks pops, yeah.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.193
That's it, that's all I wanted to say.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:31.553
I just wanted to call and tell you that.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:33.673
- You are an amazing young man.

00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:35.523
- (laughing) Thanks, pops.

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:39.423
- Hey, I just wanted
to say that I love you.

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:40.683
- I love you too!

00:02:40.683 --> 00:02:41.930
Why? Are you doing a video?

00:02:42.039 --> 00:02:45.043
- (laughs) No! Hey, that's..

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:46.413
Just, that's it.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.270
- Okay, what's going on?
- Nothing.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.110
I'm just saying I love you.

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.543
Happy Almost-Father's Day!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.440
- I love you! Thank you, Kendall.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.113
- I got two dads, I got
a stepdad that raised me,

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:58.820
and also I got a biological dad.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.500
I'm about to call my stepdad

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.189
because he's the one that raised me.

00:03:02.189 --> 00:03:04.230
(laughing)

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.680
- Hola, papi. What you doing?

00:03:06.325 --> 00:03:07.650
- I'm eating B.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.483
Are you eating, B?

00:03:08.483 --> 00:03:09.316
- I'm in a restaurant.

00:03:09.316 --> 00:03:10.149
- Oh are ya?
- What's up?

00:03:10.149 --> 00:03:11.053
I gotta tell you something.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.563
- What is it?

00:03:12.563 --> 00:03:14.390
I just called you to
tell you that I love you.

00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:15.569
- Oh yeah? (laughing)

00:03:15.569 --> 00:03:18.361
I love you too, Papi, I love you too.

00:03:18.361 --> 00:03:19.361
That's good.

00:03:20.417 --> 00:03:21.400
- No, I also want to say

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:23.220
that I appreciate everything
you've done for me.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:25.670
You raised me well, you've
always been there for me,

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.883
and, you know, you always had my back.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.230
- Stop it you're gonna
make me (beep) cry here.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.063
What's wrong with you?

00:03:31.595 --> 00:03:34.423
(laughs maniacally)

00:03:34.423 --> 00:03:36.023
You're a (beep).

00:03:36.023 --> 00:03:38.033
You know I love you too.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.403
Everything is like clockwork.

00:03:40.943 --> 00:03:41.776
- Yeah.

00:03:41.776 --> 00:03:42.609
- Everything is the same.

00:03:42.609 --> 00:03:43.920
You know I love you and
I'm very proud of you.

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:45.400
I'm very proud of everything you do too

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:47.750
and I'm proud of what
you have become as a man.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.843
No matter what, our ups and downs.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.500
You're just living proof
of that whatever we did

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.460
right or wrong, it came
out for the better,

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.710
because look how you are.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.733
- You did your job, you did
a swell job in raising me.

00:04:03.661 --> 00:04:07.150
- You're the man, you're
the man. (laughing)

00:04:07.150 --> 00:04:09.040
Right. Alright, Papi, te quiero mucho.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.823
- I love you man take it easy.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:13.130
Thank you for calling
me, appreciate it, bye.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.427
- Wow, uh. (laughs)

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.340
- [Man] That was beautiful, man.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.300
How do you feel right now?

00:04:24.762 --> 00:04:27.463
- I feel overwhelmed
(laughs) with emotions.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.823
It feels good.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.713
You don't hardly take time to,

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:32.700
I never took time to really sit down,

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:34.600
but thank you for everything
that you've done for me

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.993
and that you've given me.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:38.603
The man that I am today
is because of this man.

00:04:39.103 --> 00:04:40.383
You taught me, man.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.493
He took me on.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.000
He became a stepfather at
17-years-old, you know?

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.900
He didn't have to do none of that, so.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.140
He raised me to be a man, to be tough,

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.270
to try to do his best,
to teach me everything

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.857
and I love him.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:58.363
Yeah.

00:04:59.120 --> 00:04:59.953
If it wasn't for him,

00:04:59.953 --> 00:05:02.510
I would be in the streets
somewhere, so, that's that.

00:05:04.291 --> 00:05:07.374
(gentle piano music)

